.TH "DNF5-MAKECACHE" "8" "Sep 06, 2026" "" "dnf5"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
dnf5-makecache \- Makecache Command
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
\fBdnf5 makecache [global options]\fP
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
The \fBmakecache\fP command in \fBDNF5\fP is used for creating and downloading metadata
for enabled repositories.
.sp
It tries to avoid downloading whenever possible, e.g. when the local metadata hasn\(aqt
expired yet or when the metadata timestamp hasn\(aqt changed.
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
See AUTHORS.md in dnf5 source distribution.
.SH "حق نشر (COPYRIGHT)"
Contributors to the dnf5 project.
